flowchart TD
  P["Pythagoras:<br/>length of a vector"] --> L["Law of cosines"]
  D["Dot product:<br/>multiply, then add"] --> K["a · b =<br/>length(a) × length(b) × cos θ"]
  L --> K
  K --> C["Cosine similarity:<br/>divide out both lengths"]
  K --> J["Projection:<br/>shadow of a on b"]
  C --> R["Retrieval and analogies:<br/>nearest by cosine"]
  C --> H["Random vectors in d dims:<br/>cos ≈ 0 ± 1/√d"]
  J --> F["Reading a direction:<br/>logits, probes, offsets"]
  H --> S["Room for many<br/>nearly perpendicular directions"]
